---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updated = "September 28, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy Policy - Din Elpartner"
    description="Learn how Din Elpartner Sverige AB collects and handles personal data."
    lang="en"
>
    <section class="py-32 bg-white min-h-[60vh]">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-10">Last updated: {updated}</p>

            <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    Din Elpartner Sverige AB ("we", "us") values your privacy. This policy
                    explains what personal data we collect when you visit our website or
                    use our contact and quote forms, why we collect it, and what rights
                    you have under the GDPR.
                </p>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What data we collect</h2>
                    <p>
                        When you fill in our contact form or one of our quote forms (e.g.
                        for an electrical or air-conditioning installation), we collect the
                        information you provide yourself, typically:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                        <li>Name</li>
                        <li>Email address</li>
                        <li>Phone number</li>
                        <li>City/district and a message describing your request</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why we collect it</h2>
                    <p>
                        The data is used exclusively to respond to your enquiry, prepare
                        and send a quote, and to contact you regarding an ongoing or
                        upcoming job. The legal basis is legitimate interest (handling your
                        enquiry) and, where applicable, the explicit consent you give in
                        the form before submitting it.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Google Maps and Google reCAPTCHA</h2>
                    <p>
                        Our website uses two services from Google:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                        <li>
                            <strong>Google Maps</strong>, to show a map of our location in
                            the contact section. The map is loaded as an embedded frame
                            (iframe) directly from Google.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Google reCAPTCHA</strong>, to protect our forms against
                            spam and automated submissions.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-2">
                        Both services may load content, scripts and cookies from Google
                        when you view the page, whether or not you use the forms. Google
                        may process data in connection with this, such as your IP address.
                        We recommend reading
                        {" "}
                        <a
                            href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="text-accent-hover underline hover:text-gray-900"
                        >Google's own privacy policy</a>
                        {" "}for more information on how Google handles this data.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How long we keep your data</h2>
                    <p>
                        We keep your data for as long as needed to handle your enquiry and
                        any resulting job, and thereafter in line with applicable
                        accounting and warranty rules where relevant. We never sell your
                        data to third parties.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Your rights</h2>
                    <p>
                        Under the GDPR you have the right to request access to, correction
                        of, or deletion of your personal data held by us, and to object to
                        our processing of it. Contact us using the details below to
                        exercise your rights.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Contact</h2>
                    <p>
                        The data controller is Din Elpartner Sverige AB, represented by
                        Peter Palka. For questions about this policy, or to exercise your
                        rights, contact us at:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@dinelpartner.se" class="text-accent-hover underline hover:text-gray-900">info@dinelpartner.se</a></li>
                        <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+46700235436" class="text-accent-hover underline hover:text-gray-900">+46 70 023 54 36</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/en/" class="inline-block mt-12 text-accent-hover hover:underline font-semibold"
                >← Back to Home</a
            >
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
